# rhwp HFT symbol fixes for why-hwp, measured against Hangul 2024 output.
# Base: rhwp 981ce66b4 (v0.9.1) after the source edits in wasm/patch-rhwp.sh and every
# earlier wasm/patches/*.patch in name order.
# Zero-context diff (apply with git apply --unidiff-zero).
#
# - svg.rs: an HFT `–`, `†` or `※` whose cell is a full em is drawn centred in
#   that cell. The cell is a full em by the fallback rule or, since rhwp v0.9.1,
#   by the HFT program's own width table.
# - font_metrics_overlays.rs: bold 한양중고딕 curly quotes keep their program advance.
# - layout/text_measurement.rs and svg/tests.rs cover these changes.
